<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" adaptive="false" time-dependent="false" xml:lang="nl-NL" identifier="ITEM005" title="Fouten zoeken">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="multiple" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>ANTWOORDE</qti-value><qti-value>GEBEURD</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
    <qti-mapping default-value="-1" lower-bound="0">
      <qti-map-entry map-key="ANTWOORDE" mapped-value="1" />
      <qti-map-entry map-key="GEBEURD" mapped-value="1" />
    </qti-mapping>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" base-type="float" cardinality="single">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="MAXSCORE" base-type="float" cardinality="single">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>2</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" base-type="identifier" cardinality="single" />
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="KEUZE" base-type="identifier" cardinality="multiple" />
  <qti-item-body>
    <p>In deze tekst staan <strong>twee</strong> fout gespelde werkwoorden. Klik ze aan.</p>
    <qti-hottext-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" max-choices="2">
      <p>Vorige week <qti-hottext identifier="VERHUISDE">verhuisde</qti-hottext> mijn oom naar Utrecht.
        Hij <qti-hottext identifier="ANTWOORDE">antwoorde</qti-hottext> niet toen ik hem belde.
        Nu <qti-hottext identifier="WORDT">wordt</qti-hottext> zijn nieuwe huis
        <qti-hottext identifier="GEVERFD">geverfd</qti-hottext> en <qti-hottext identifier="GEBEURD">gebeurd</qti-hottext> er van alles.</p>
    </qti-hottext-interaction>
    <p>
      <qti-feedback-inline identifier="VERHUISDE" outcome-identifier="KEUZE" show-hide="show"><em>verhuisde</em> is goed: verhuizen heeft een z, dus -de.</qti-feedback-inline>
      <qti-feedback-inline identifier="WORDT" outcome-identifier="KEUZE" show-hide="show"><em>wordt</em> is goed: het huis = het, dus stam + t.</qti-feedback-inline>
      <qti-feedback-inline identifier="GEVERFD" outcome-identifier="KEUZE" show-hide="show"><em>geverfd</em> is goed: verven heeft een v, dus -d.</qti-feedback-inline>
    </p>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="GOED" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show" class="qti-feedback-correct">
      <qti-content-body><p><strong>Goed zo!</strong> Je hebt beide fouten gevonden.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="HINT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show" class="qti-feedback-hint">
      <qti-content-body><p><strong>Nog niet helemaal goed.</strong> Er staat nog een fout, of je hebt een goed woord aangeklikt. Kijk vooral naar de d's en t's.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="UITLEG" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show" class="qti-feedback-incorrect">
      <qti-content-body><p><strong>Uitleg:</strong> <em>antwoordde</em>: stam antwoord + de, dus twee d's. <em>er gebeurt</em>: tegenwoordige tijd, het onderwerp is <em>er van alles</em> (= het), dus stam + t.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="KEUZE"><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE" /></qti-set-outcome-value>
    <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-map-response identifier="RESPONSE" /></qti-set-outcome-value>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-gte><qti-variable identifier="SCORE" /><qti-variable identifier="MAXSCORE" /></qti-gte>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">GOED</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else-if>
        <qti-lte><qti-variable identifier="numAttempts" /><qti-base-value base-type="integer">1</qti-base-value></qti-lte>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">HINT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-else-if>
      <qti-response-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">UITLEG</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
